      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊！这、这样啊。嘿、嘿嘿……\n我只是有点紧张而已呗！来、来吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "279fafcd24279c1dc14cee26e74559d0c5bcb245dad9eb764be58cb53907234c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
